      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this resume for the job role: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Job Role'] }}\n\nResume:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nReturn ONLY JSON with:\n- score (0-100)\n- skills\n- strengths\n- weaknesses\n- recommendation (Selected/Rejected)\n- summary\n\nExtract the following information:\n\n1. Overall score (0-100)\n2. Total years of professional experience.\n3. Experience Level.\n4. Technical skills.\n5. Strengths.\n6. Weaknesses.\n7. Recommendation.\n8. Summary.\n\nExperience Rules:\n- Calculate total professional experience from the resume.\n- Do not count education as work experience.\n- If only internships are mentioned, mention them separately and return \"Fresher (0 years)\" unless full-time experience is clearly stated.\n- Experience Level Rules:\n  • 0 years → Fresher\n  • 0–2 years → Junior\n  • 2–5 years → Mid-Level\n  • 5+ years → Senior\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON matching the schema.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
